─ ✦ ── ⋅ ⋅ ── ⋅ ⋅ ──\n\nMy character is a smug demon overlord!\nI have a lot of different references on my website below!\nhttps://fream.gg/fream\n\nI have 3 hair colors Blue (longer side), Pink, and Teal (shorter side!)\nMy tongue is blue and I have spiky shark teeth! I also have a white bandaid on my nose!\nMy blush is blue just in case you need to know that!\n\nI also have a super cute mascot named Spike that is at the bottom of my reference page!\nFeel free to include him if you wish! Only one eye has an \"X\" on it!\n\nhttps://fream.gg/fream\n\nhttps://fream.gg/fream", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kasuteLa0405/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1422954, "client_id": 2247303, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=432df8b9490285beeebe5ab4bb3a4a81", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=432df8b9490285beeebe5ab4bb3a4a81, https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=999eb25c2f273204088b94e4e70ae68b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8db2bb4d9250c0dd684b4a45abb5fdb4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3735a0c1cb6583ad51fc07991d6a1b8b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3735a0c1cb6583ad51fc07991d6a1b8b, https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33bb9de59b2167f7cc133944e2941a1f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/82f0d1a6/uploads/origins/7307b3c7-6aed-49fe-925a-75843de9c49a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8305306c8f33bf28bc86ed872113849 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art is so beautiful and I love it very much! I would like to request my character Peregrine.\n\nPeregrine [162cm] is a fun and upbeat photographer. She has blond hair with blue dye on the ends, tanned skin with a mole under her left eye, and dark brown-black eyes. She has a lean body with a somewhat flat chest. She works as a detective, and she believes in trying her very best, even when it's hard. Her themes are photography, daises, birds or chicks, and lemons. The outfit and pose can be up to you!\n\nI very much enjoy your recent work with the collage-style art and would love something similar for my request. Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16U2B9Jxm7jUCpJUDBOobBm_A9wYx3uir?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kasuteLa0405/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1422954, "client_id": 2407984, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=198fbc5319b41216ba06890bd71467c2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=198fbc5319b41216ba06890bd71467c2, https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46c711a1d727c6e1e23ffe1be01aa720 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2717ce1f18f5c81bb701b1a84ebb6a10 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3560b79f816159a05dfa23dfb1dfa3e3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3560b79f816159a05dfa23dfb1dfa3e3, https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b4c12ac49f78b64b2b05a0d7fa4ea4f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f027fd9/uploads/origins/530b431d-7814-49db-a171-06eeb9356b8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a3591d74ced1e661fa844d97d1f8717c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love the style and composition of your artworks! I would like to request my character.\n\nHer name is Thirteen (29 years old, 160cm) and she has an androgynous look. \n- She used to be a cop who became bitter and disillusioned so she quit and joined an organisation to kill monsters instead. \n- Though she looks tired and soulless, hunting monsters and living dangerously has made her feel more alive.\n- Her personality is calm and easy-going, but secretive. \n- There is a sense that she yearns for a home in others but is afraid to stay. \n- She is the kind of person to come and go like a stray cat.\n- She likes the ocean and is often surrounded by water.\n- She smokes a lot\n\nPossible scenarios:  smoking on the rooftop, losing a fight, sitting in a bathtub full of water, falling out of the window, sinking in the ocean. Feel free to draw anything that interests you! \n\nThemes are: water, deep ocean, bathtub, stray black cats, smoking, blue, moon, sky\n\nPlease note there is a scar across her nose. Feel free to style her however you like. She often wears masculine clothing.\n\nThank you for considering my request.\n\nhttps://tree-kun.notion.site/Thirteen-6b917091f68345a5aa30c2b3c456c052?pvs=4", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kasuteLa0405/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1422954, "client_id": 53582, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6710343/uploads/origins/e4ec629d-f27d-4b67-8cc6-b3b25dfb7742?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37113b425bc1dbb8b6d0f91b42a12e82", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d6710343/uploads/origins/e4ec629d-f27d-4b67-8cc6-b3b25dfb7742?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37113b425bc1dbb8b6d0f91b42a12e82, https://si.imgix.net/d6710343/uploads/origins/e4ec629d-f27d-4b67-8cc6-b3b25dfb7742?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52849e2d3444d2ea4fdac333998e70e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d6710343/uploads/origins/e4ec629d-f27d-4b67-8cc6-b3b25dfb7742?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f721ee741234d6e195ab91247a9ca2eb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6710343/uploads/origins/e4ec629d-f27d-4b67-8cc6-b3b25dfb7742?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d5bb0d5f3ae5187bda956edc2257b