7451-58c9-4f03-9e45-8ac87c02941c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b25f52f290b50aa8aa9a614ad8b7d59 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14e52e43/uploads/origins/31467451-58c9-4f03-9e45-8ac87c02941c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e3a56a0e70095bbc2a926499a381b56f 3x"}, "body": "Hi!! I love your style so so much! Your expressions are so beautiful! If possible, could I please have an illustration of my character below in the outfit attached? She wears her hair in braids. She is very egotistical and smug, sort of like Gojo Satoru! She is very intelligent, and manipulative. Any pose is fine, I am so grateful for your work! Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1AXaEegvDLr9HY3q4YRMdjKXVuvUS-xUN/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1BA5yW47s5fuiaSOMaoGxmRFByatpVbX9/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kasuteLa0405/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1422954, "client_id": 3206532, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ccf020d52cb51978022b7077e137638", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ccf020d52cb51978022b7077e137638, https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25bd5992c648cd91506cbd3738acf323 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=096ada3994d3df5c1281b6401fafad82 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=199fec40ddeb3eca99f6fc5ff3433646", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=199fec40ddeb3eca99f6fc5ff3433646, https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00102a5ea86ab131d7c0c19dcae743f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d09474a7/uploads/origins/e19d0201-0009-4b9a-9caa-424f1fe0607e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01d84039d19c99b40e0173a63b44e6c2 3x"}, "body": "Dear ZARAme\n\nNice to meet you!\nMy name is subject 086 and I am a Vtuber!\nI was attracted by your drawing style, and I was wondering if you would be interested in drawing me.\n\n▶Usage\n\nI will use it for commercial purposes.\n\nUse in video clips, thumbnails, and distribution screens on sites such as Youtube (already monetized)\nAdvertising on social networking sites\nSelling goods (possible)\n\n▶Requests\n\nShe is a mouse-human hybrid zombie researcher girl.\nShe has both mouse and human ears.\nSince she is a zombie, she has stitches and her skin color is slightly purple.\n\n☆ Mouse ears: The green eyes are smaller and the red eyes are larger.\nThe eyeballs in the mouse ears are given by listeners, so they are individually conscious.\n\nComposition\n\nPosed holding the eyeballs with her fingers separately from the ornaments.\n(The composition is up to the artist, but the following picture drawn by ZARAme fits the image!)\nhttps://x.com/kasuteLa0405/status/1622228720525402114\n\nExpression\n\nA mischievous expression or an expression as if he/she has found a treasure.\n\n☆Mouth shaped like an omega with two fangs.\n☆Odd eyes with green left eye and vivid pink right eye\n\nClothing\n\nPlease refer to the following images\nhttps://x.com/Hikentai086/status/1761068791818240028\n\nYou are welcome to arrange both your clothes and hairstyle.\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kasuteLa0405/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1422954, "client_id": 3062932, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6f6181218f4cb773052b953c0b7e596", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6f6181218f4cb773052b953c0b7e596, https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e3b3a7de574e9a090646ec74ae0f1e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dca0d84e6c425439eae42ad6ba62d35b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=43f1cd3b8a0fc0a24a8f36b8ba610ef5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=43f1cd3b8a0fc0a24a8f36b8ba610ef5, https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f4b1314af7c08466407357ea316269f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b7c1b89c/uploads/origins/17011797-472b-43be-b68e-c975a7dbeeb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d04255e680392d7d4aedad8815e4a73 3x"}, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you! I really like your painting style and I hope you can draw my OC. She's from a game where you can create your own avatar.\nThis is a female character. She looks unfriendly and has a scar on her face, so some people may think she's sharp, but she actually loves animals and has a cute personality.\nI leave the pose, composition,outfit, etc. up to you. Sorry that I don’t have much schematic diagram for my OC.I hope you can draw her with full body.\n\nI've saw your art on twitter and i don't know if you accept female commission, so if you have any problems with the content of request, please feel free to decline. Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eOF6kD19tt8WWd3Izs3QNaCH0biVQ4qX?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kasuteLa0405/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1422954, "client_id": 3015400, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b76411f10328845adb16f396144a7a4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b76411f10328845adb16f396144a7a4, https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d36d6f5587d7389d704d6b78d0671b75 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb0050645f81b6c0fde81e3777e11153 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b17e262f3559c4941726784d642b15c2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b17e262f3559c4941726784d642b15c2, https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b116fe66784361bff9ad6bea1443c61 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dc8187f5/uploads/origins/f4db3643-7e9f-47d7-aa3b-a308efc17c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5a327bc151c132834deff137ea13ffe7 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really admire your art style and would love to request a drawing of my character. His name is \"Lionfish\".\n\nHe is a fighter who is always angry and stressed, and he talks down to people. He has the personality of a mad dog, and hates being told what to do. On the inside he's very sensitive. His motifs are lionfishes, the sea, saltwater, poison, blood, hunger, and revenge.\n\n- He has three scars on both shoulders.\n- His ear piercings are the same on both sides.\n- He likes to dress in punk clothes, or in traditional Chinese clothing. Masculine and feminine styles both okay! Feel free to dress him up in whatever outfit you like.\n- Please style his hair however you want.\n\nPossible scenarios are him losing a fight, or getting into an argument, but feel free to draw whatever scenario interests you!\n\nThank you for considering my request! I hope you have a lovely day! ٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و ♡\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T-xrIPj-Yrb2FYVNa74z_iuFoCWeJmxt?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 881, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "みるお", "screen_name": "milleoxox", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1225312996622159872/2us1U7__.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2775804750/1607276190/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 128}, {"id": 1944575, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "ちん@Skeb", "screen_name": "chinchinnn", "avatar_url": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/?d=identicon", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 2969718, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "兎羅", "screen_name": "suke_228", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1784884773174882304/CaCIcfc_.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1649763401848201217/1714385030/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 